  "packageSize": 110853,
  "published": "2026-10-15T22:19:47.727Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0-rc.2.3: built on SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.3.\n\n0.1.0-rc.2.2: built on SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.2.\n\n0.1.0-rc.2.1: SkiaToggleButton works inside SkiaCollectionView item templates: rows are drawn from their items, a tap writes SelectedValue (or a SkiaToggleGroup container's) into the row's item and runs Command, groups follow, a drag scrolls the list. Requires SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2.1.\n\n0.1.0-rc.2: First preview. SkiaCalendarView, SkiaToggleButton, SkiaComboBox, SkiaSelectorView and SkiaGalleryView (swipeable images with page indicators; inside SkiaCollectionView item templates it is baked with the row and comes alive under the finger). Requires .NET 11 / MAUI 11 RC2.",
